  "Pooling (kernel.rs:516-543): per element two libm::log10 (lane-exact) + two f64 adds, raster order.",
  "Halo: 'valid' stats trims floor(nk/2) per side at each scale; the pre-filters trim the same before decimating. Radius per stage = (nk-1)/2 in stage grid x scale factor. Boundary trims are 'valid' (no padding work).",
